NPlayerSpawn - Player Spawn Editor 2

A fully featured spawn-point manager for Garry's Mod, designed for servers that need clean, reliable and configurable player spawn control. This module lets you define, edit and organize spawn locations with precision, using a simple interface and an optimized backend suitable for RP, Sandbox, PVP or custom environments.

Features

Full management of spawn points per category or per map

Intuitive interface to add, move or remove positions

Automatic saving to prevent any data loss

Optimized for performance on demanding servers

Clean, modular code that integrates easily with existing systems

Installation

Download the script.

Drop the folder into garrysmod/addons.

Restart your server.

Configure your spawn points through the built-in tool.

Configuration

The module is built to stay straightforward. All essential options are grouped in one place for quick setup without unnecessary clutter.

-- Basic example
NPlayerSpawn.AddSpawn(vector(0,0,0), angle(0,0,0))

Why this module exists

Many servers rely on rigid or outdated spawn systems, often leading to bad placement or chaotic player clustering.
This script solves those issues by giving you precise control while remaining lightweight. It also prevents the classic scenario where three players spawn on top of each other, which is always a win for server quality.

